C%22count%22%3A100%2C%22url%22%3A%22%2Fbh3%2Fwiki%2Fcontent%2F1274%2Fdetail%22%7D%2C%7B%22name%22%3A%22%E8%B6%85%E5%AF%BC%E9%87%91%E5%B1%9E%E6%B0%A2%22%2C%22count%22%3A220%2C%22url%22%3A%22%2Fbh3%2Fwiki%2Fcontent%2F1140%2Fdetail%22%7D%2C%7B%22name%22%3A%22%E6%B5%81%E4%BD%93%E5%90%88%E9%87%91%E5%9D%97%22%2C%22count%22%3A18%2C%22url%22%3A%22%2Fbh3%2Fwiki%2Fcontent%2F1890%2Fdetail%22%7D%5D%7D%5D%7D%7D%5D\" data-ts=\"1703472437717\" data-col-type=\"l2r1\"><div style=\"order: 0;\"> <div data-part=\"info\" data-tmpl=\"weapon\" class=\"obc-tmpl__part obc-tmpl-weapon obc-tmpl__part--info obc-tmpl__part--align-banner\"><h1>武器数据</h1> <table class=\"obc-tmpl__gain-method obc-tmpl-weapon__info-table\"><colgroup><col> <col> <col></colgroup> <tbody><tr><td rowspan=\"3\" class=\"obc-tmpl-weapon__info-avatar\"><img src=\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/bh3-wiki/2023/12/19/50494840/0dcfff6c3e2ede3ea219db5241c14814_1085002702743041478.png\" alt=\"\"></td> <td class=\"h3\">星级</td> <td colspan=\"5\"><div class=\"obc-tmpl-weapon__info-stars\"><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i></div></td></tr> <tr><td class=\"h3\">攻击</td> <td colspan=\"5\" class=\"obc-tmpl__rich-text\">442</td></tr><tr><td class=\"h3\">会心</td> <td colspan=\"5\" class=\"obc-tmpl__rich-text\">18</td></tr></tbody></table> <div class=\"obc-tmpl-weapon__info-desc\"><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">千载东风吹世换，算来几梦浮生。</p><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">转蓬飞絮复宵征。依依多少事，转眼芜已平。</p><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap; min-height: 1.5em;\"></p><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">聚散别离都一晌，水去云回经行。</p><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">重见太平心已明。人间非逆旅，身亦在归程。</p></div> <!----></div></div><div style=\"order: 1;\"> <div data-part=\"skill\" data-tmpl=\"weapon\" class=\"obc-tmpl__part obc-tmpl-weapon obc-tmpl__part--skill obc-tmpl__part--align-banner\"><h2>武器技能</h2> <table class=\"obc-tmpl__gain-method\"><colgroup><col> <col></colgroup> <tbody><tr><td class=\"h3\">十方拂煦</td> <td colspan=\"5\" class=\"obc-tmpl__rich-text\"><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">[能量消耗:0][冷却:17秒]展开一个持续5秒的领域，处于该领域内自身造成的全伤害提高30.0%，该效果在离开领域后仍能持续10秒，重复触发刷新持续时间。浮生 · 渡尘之羽装备时，QTE及切换架势也能触发该领域，领域生成时根据自身所处架势立即为领域内敌人附加对应的【羽燃之印】并移除另一架势对应的【羽燃之印】，带有【羽燃之印】的敌人受到对应架势的分支攻击时，【羽燃之印】引爆并造成300.0%攻击力的火焰元素伤害，【羽燃之印】持续5秒。离场时移除领域和所有【羽燃之印】</p></td></tr><tr><td class=\"h3\">百世不磨</td> <td colspan=\"5\" class=\"obc-tmpl__rich-text\"><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">火焰元素伤害提高30.0%。角色最大生命值超过7000点时，全伤害提高20.0%。</p></td></tr><tr><td class=\"h3\">千秋靖晏</td> <td colspan=\"5\" class=\"obc-tmpl__rich-text\"><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">一次性回复500点生命值时，使场上敌人受到来自自身的火焰元素伤害提高24.0%，持续15秒，重复触发刷新持续时间。处于场上期间一次性降低100点生命值时，回复15点能量，触发间隔15秒</p></td></tr></tbody></table> <!----></div></div><div style=\"order: 2;\"> <div data-part=\"forging\" data-tmpl=\"weapon\" class=\"obc-tmpl__part obc-tmpl-weapon obc-tmpl__part--forging obc-tmpl__part--align-banner\"><h2>悬赏锻造</h2> <table class=\"obc-tmpl__gain-method\"><colgroup><col> <col></colgroup> <tbody><tr><td class=\"h3\">超限素材</td> <td colspan=\"5\"><div class=\"forging-material-td\"><div class=\"obc-tmpl__icon-text-num\"><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"/bh3/wiki/content/2960/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\"><img src=\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/bh3-wiki/2023/12/20/50494840/0dcfff6c3e2ede3ea219db5241c14814_3395946460084310216.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"obc-tmpl__icon\"><span class=\"obc-tmpl__icon-text\">解锁「万古一炬」图鉴后任意拳套蛋池武器</span></a> <span class=\"obc-tmpl__icon-num\">*1</span></div></div></td></tr> <tr><td class=\"h3\">其他素材</td> <td colspan=\"5\"><div class=\"forging-other-material-td\"><div class=\"obc-tmpl__icon-text-num\"><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"/bh3/wiki/content/1274/detail\"><!----><span class=\"obc-tmpl__icon-text\">爱因斯坦环磁机</span></a> <span class=\"obc-tmpl__icon-num\">*100</span></div><div class=\"obc-tmpl__icon-text-num\"><a targe